  "descriptionHtml": "<div class='product-description'>Star-studded, special-edition AF1 Low silhouette for standout style\n        Premium leather upper with tonal, stitched-on leather stars for a showstopping look\nLeather Swooshes on the sides and Nike Air on the heel for signature AF1 detailing\n        Perforations throughout for enhanced ventilation\n        Full-length, encapsulated Nike Air unit for lightweight cushioning\n        Lace closure with a star-shaped metal dubrae charm for a secure fit\n        Durable rubber cupsole with a pivot-circle pattern for grippy traction\n        The Nike Air Force 1 '07 is imported\nNike turns up the luster on an undisputed legend with the Men's Nike Air Force 1 '07 Low LE Stars Casual Shoes. A rich leather upper with intricate, dimensional star stitching and signature Swoosh overlays adds a stellar touch to the iconic silhouette. Finished with a star-shaped metal charm on the laces, this iteration goes all-out for a head-turning pair guaranteed to have onlookers seeing stars.</div>\n\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin: 20px 0;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Specifications</h3>\n  <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;\">\n    <tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Brand</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Nike</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Model</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Men's Nike Air Force 1 '07 Low LE Stars Casual Shoes</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Gender</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Men's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Sizing Category</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Adult</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Color</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>White/White/Metallic Silver</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Manufacturer SKU</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>3378480</td></tr>